  "definition": "Minimum Distances",
  "effectiveDate": "2026-02-01",
  "expirationDate": "2036-02-01",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1000) #11184, eff 10-1-16; ss by #14486, eff 2-1-26, EXPIRES: 2-1-36 (formerly Env-Wq 1008.04)",
